{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379160/extras/251d0a39f1c5682233c5118f89194f2d.poster.avif?t=1771430066\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379160/extras/251d0a39f1c5682233c5118f89194f2d.webm?t=1771430066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379160/extras/251d0a39f1c5682233c5118f89194f2d.mp4?t=1771430066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A New Kind of Combo RPG</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Signy &amp; Mino: Against All Gods lets you create over-the-top combos in a calculated, turn-based fashion. Positioning is key: line up your power attack and your target will damage other enemies along its journey. Launch your target skyward, juggle them, then smash them back into the ground. Call Mino to dig them up and continue the combo OR, sacrifice  HP to push your limit and head straight into the next target. Cap it off with a full-screen finisher to shred all affected enemies. And that\u2019s just one possible sequence- Most moves combo into each other with the right timing, so get creative! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379160/extras/2b87315bcbb8873d6d5b666aa1d440d3.poster.avif?t=1771430066\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379160/extras/2b87315bcbb8873d6d5b666aa1d440d3.webm?t=1771430066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379160/extras/2b87315bcbb8873d6d5b666aa1d440d3.mp4?t=1771430066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A World Held Captive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regional travel has been sealed off after a disaster at the Mountain Research Center. Journey through lush forests, a magical island, a hidden temple, and even the research center itself as you uncover a dark chain of events that lead to present day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379160/extras/5cb19f0a833ab68c34f6004b34513119.poster.avif?t=1771430066\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379160/extras/5cb19f0a833ab68c34f6004b34513119.webm?t=1771430066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379160/extras/5cb19f0a833ab68c34f6004b34513119.mp4?t=1771430066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Conflict Amongst Gods</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A volcanic explosion masks a much more sinister problem: The rebirth of a Mountain God with an axe to grind. Join forces with other fallen gods and washed-up warriors as you take on the burden of being the only one who can face an indestructible foe.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2379160?t=1771430066","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2379160?t=1771430066","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379160/858caccc0429a8cc2376032da2500ddaa62d4f3f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771430066","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379160/858caccc0429a8cc2376032da2500ddaa62d4f3f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771430066","categories":